0 Technic hub motor bench (Brickwright Robot Lab reference model)
0 Name: technic-hub-bench.ldr
0 Author: Brickwright
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // A Technic Hub (Control+) with a Technic large motor on its port A, both pinned to an
0 // 11-hole beam; the motor turns a 24-tooth gear on an axle. The legopoweredup blocks drive it
0 // over Web Bluetooth or Scratch Link, as a real hub (docs/SIM-LAB.md "Powered Up, BOOST, WeDo").
0 !BW ID hub
1 71 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 22127.dat
0 !BW ID beam
1 72 100 0 0 0 1 0 -1 0 0 0 0 1 32525.dat
0 !BW ID pinHub1
1 0 90 0 60 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 2780.dat
0 !BW ID pinHub2
1 0 90 0 -60 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 2780.dat
0 !BW ID motor
0 !BW PORT A
1 72 140 -20 -100 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 22169.dat
0 !BW ID pinMotor1
1 0 110 0 -100 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 2780.dat
0 !BW ID pinMotor2
1 0 110 0 40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 2780.dat
0 !BW ID axle
1 0 140 -20 -150 0 0 1 0 1 0 -1 0 0 3706.dat
0 !BW ID gear
1 4 140 -20 -190 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3648.dat
